WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 67040db223d368bf578fa7dd62694f9e

00:00:00.338 --> 00:00:02.137
Habari. Karibu kwenye uchambuzi mwingine wa kina.

00:00:02.137 --> 00:00:06.097
Zoezi hili, tena, ni moja ambalo wakati mwingine
watu hulipata kuwa gumu kidogo na

00:00:06.097 --> 00:00:09.858
hukwama. Kwa hiyo kama unatazama
video hii ndani ya zoezi na umekwama,

00:00:10.817 --> 00:00:15.298
sheria ni zile zile kama kawaida. Tazama hadi
utakapopata njia, kisha isimamishe na

00:00:15.298 --> 00:00:18.897
kisha uendelee. Kama ulilitatua
mwenyewe, hongera.

00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:22.338
Kuna mambo kadhaa ya kuvutia
humu, kwa hiyo hebu tuangalie haraka.

00:00:22.978 --> 00:00:29.318
Basi, kwanza kabisa, nataka kusema kuhusu
wazo hili la kusogeza vitu hatua moja kwa wakati.

00:00:29.478 --> 00:00:33.398
Lengo la zoezi hili
ni kwamba tunasogeza vitu

00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:36.758
mara kwa mara, hatua moja kwa wakati, hivi.

00:00:37.718 --> 00:00:40.838
Hebu tufanye michache zaidi. Sita, saba, nane.

00:00:41.237 --> 00:00:42.917
Hebu tuende hadi 60.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.277
Kwa kufanya hivi,
tunaunda aina hii ya uhuishaji

00:00:48.677 --> 00:00:51.567
ambapo mpira unabingirika, na unabingirika vizuri.

00:00:54.368 --> 00:00:58.408
Katika zoezi lililopita, ulikuwa na kitendakazi hiki
cha `roll` kilichokufanyia haya.

00:00:58.408 --> 00:01:02.207
Ulisema tu, bingirisha hadi 70,
na kingebingirisha mpira.

00:01:03.408 --> 00:01:06.447
Lakini kwa ndani,
ulipoita kitendakazi hicho cha `roll`,

00:01:06.528 --> 00:01:09.248
kinachotokea hasa ni
hiki hasa unachokiona hapa.

00:01:10.367 --> 00:01:12.927
Hakiwezi kubingirisha tu kutoka
sehemu moja hadi nyingine.

00:01:13.087 --> 00:01:16.207
Tunapaswa kuonyesha kila pikseli
kwenye skrini.

00:01:16.858 --> 00:01:21.257
Kwa hiyo kila mara katika mchezo wowote unapoona
kitu kikisogea kutoka A hadi B,

00:01:21.578 --> 00:01:26.778
huo daima ni uhuishaji ambapo kila hatua,
kila pikseli, imefafanuliwa.

00:01:26.858 --> 00:01:28.418
Sasa, bila shaka, tunaweza kuandika msimbo,

00:01:28.418 --> 00:01:32.537
kama msimbo tunaouandika katika
zoezi hili, ili kutengeneza uhuishaji laini

00:01:32.858 --> 00:01:35.257
bila kulazimika kuandika
hatua kwa hatua kwa hatua.

00:01:35.737 --> 00:01:38.537
Lakini daima tunapitia
mchakato huo tunapohuisha,

00:01:38.537 --> 00:01:42.908
wa kusema tunahitaji kusogeza kitu
kupitia hatua hizi zote tofauti,

00:01:43.308 --> 00:01:45.947
na tunaweza kuwa na kasi
tofauti za kusogea.

00:01:45.947 --> 00:01:48.587
Unajua, unaweza kusogea nusu
pikseli kila mara kisha

00:01:48.587 --> 00:01:53.147
kuongeza kasi hadi pikseli 2 kila mara ili kitu
kionekane kinakwenda kwa kasi zaidi au polepole.

00:01:53.308 --> 00:01:56.587
Unaweza kuongeza ucheleweshaji zaidi kati ya
kila mstari wa msimbo unaoendeshwa.

00:01:56.987 --> 00:02:00.587
Lakini unapofikiria kuhuisha
katika muundo wowote wa kidijitali,

00:02:00.828 --> 00:02:03.628
hiki ndicho unachofanya
hasa.

00:02:04.507 --> 00:02:06.188
Basi hebu tufikirie tunachojaribu
kufanya hapa.

00:02:06.188 --> 00:02:08.948
Kimsingi tunajaribu
kufanya tulichofanya katika

00:02:08.948 --> 00:02:11.467
zoezi lililopita la
kupanda maua,

00:02:11.548 --> 00:02:13.788
ambapo tulikuwa tunasogeza nafasi mbele.

00:02:14.168 --> 00:02:17.687
Lakini badala ya kusogeza nafasi
10 mbele kama mara iliyopita,

00:02:17.687 --> 00:02:19.768
tutasogeza nafasi
moja tu mbele.

00:02:20.967 --> 00:02:24.768
Kwa hiyo tunataka kurudia
`move_to` hii mara kadhaa.

00:02:24.768 --> 00:02:27.687
Tuseme tunataka kuirudia
mara 50 kwa kuanzia,

00:02:27.927 --> 00:02:30.967
na tunataka kuwa na mpangilio ule ule
tuliokuwa nao mara iliyopita,

00:02:30.967 --> 00:02:35.687
yaani variable ya nafasi, `position`. Tuseme
tunaianzisha kwa sasa kwenye 30.

00:02:36.168 --> 00:02:40.568
Na tunataka kusogea hadi nafasi hiyo,
kisha tunataka kusogeza.

00:02:40.967 --> 00:02:44.647
Tunataka kubadilisha nafasi
iongezeke kwa moja kila mara,

00:02:46.568 --> 00:02:50.967
hivi. Kwa hiyo weka variable,
sogea hadi hapo, sasisha nafasi hiyo,

00:02:51.048 --> 00:02:52.328
na tutapata uhuishaji huu

00:02:53.448 --> 00:02:57.527
ili tuone. Inafanya kazi. Inaanzia
hapa, inahuishwa hadi hapa, na kadhalika.

00:02:58.328 --> 00:03:04.087
Kwa hiyo kama tunajenga mchezo wa gofu, kama tunavyofanya,
lengo letu ni kuubingirisha kutoka kigingi hapa,

00:03:04.087 --> 00:03:06.008
mpira unapoanzia, hadi shimoni.

00:03:06.407 --> 00:03:08.008
Kwa hiyo tunajua tunapotaka kuanzia.

00:03:08.168 --> 00:03:14.087
Nafasi ya kuanzia ni 28. Na
tunajua tunahitaji kusogea idadi fulani ya

00:03:14.487 --> 00:03:17.848
hatua hadi shimoni. Kwa hiyo tunasogea umbali gani?

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:25.048
Basi tuseme tuna umbali, `distance`,
na umbali wetu ni lengo letu, ambalo ni 88,

00:03:25.527 --> 00:03:28.407
toa sehemu yetu ya kuanzia, ambayo ni 28.

00:03:29.048 --> 00:03:31.608
Na tunaweza kutumia umbali huu humu.

00:03:32.328 --> 00:03:35.687
Kwa hiyo tunaweza kusema tuna sanduku moja,
ambalo ni nafasi yetu.

00:03:36.487 --> 00:03:38.967
Tuna sanduku jingine ambalo ni umbali wetu,

00:03:40.717 --> 00:03:42.888
na limewekwa 88, ambalo ni lengo letu,

00:03:44.008 --> 00:03:47.448
toa nafasi tunayoanzia,
toa hii 28.

00:03:47.927 --> 00:03:50.807
Kisha tutarudia
idadi ya mara sawa na umbali.

00:03:52.647 --> 00:03:55.527
Sasa, hii haitafanya kazi bado.
Tutaona kwa nini baada ya muda mfupi.

00:03:55.687 --> 00:03:58.407
Lakini hebu kwanza tuhakikishe
tunaelewa kinachoendelea hapa.

00:03:58.407 --> 00:04:03.048
Hebu tuanze mwanzoni. Tuna
sanduku la nafasi lenye 28 ndani yake.

00:04:03.818 --> 00:04:09.177
Kisha tuna sanduku la umbali. Tunaanza kwa kuchukua
sanduku la nafasi na kutoa 28 ndani yake.

00:04:09.258 --> 00:04:13.698
Kwa sanduku hili tulilotengeneza, tunafanya 88 toa 28.

00:04:13.698 --> 00:04:19.257
Tunapata 60. Tunaunda sanduku jipya liitwalo
`distance`, kisha tunaweka 60 ndani ya sanduku hilo.

00:04:19.257 --> 00:04:23.577
Kwa hiyo sasa tuna masanduku mawili kwenye rafu,
sanduku la nafasi na sanduku la umbali.

00:04:24.218 --> 00:04:27.817
Kisha tunapoita `repeat`,
badala ya kuweka namba humu,

00:04:28.057 --> 00:04:32.557
tunaweka sanduku humu. Kwa hiyo
nini kinatokea Jiki anapoona hili?

00:04:32.557 --> 00:04:35.278
Basi, anakwenda na kuchukua
sanduku la umbali kutoka rafuni.

00:04:35.437 --> 00:04:39.877
Anatoa 60 ndani yake, na anajua kwamba
lazima arudie kitanzi hiki mara 60.

00:04:39.877 --> 00:04:42.637
Anaangalia namba ya sasa: ni moja.

00:04:42.718 --> 00:04:44.637
Je, hatua ya sasa, moja, ni ndogo kuliko 60?

00:04:44.637 --> 00:04:48.557
Ndiyo, ni ndogo. Kwa hiyo anaingia
humu na kuanza kulifanyia kazi hili.

00:04:49.598 --> 00:04:51.677
Tungeweza kufanya hivi kwa mkono tu.

00:04:51.838 --> 00:04:55.757
Tungeweza kusema tu rudia mara 60,
ambayo huenda ndivyo ulivyofanya.

00:04:57.038 --> 00:05:02.798
Au tunaweza kufanya hivi kwa njia hii
iliyoendelea kidogo ambapo tunatumia maneno,

00:05:02.798 --> 00:05:06.158
tunatumia masanduku kufanya msimbo wetu
uwe wazi zaidi kidogo.

00:05:06.158 --> 00:05:10.398
Kwa hiyo badala ya kuwa na 60 hii ya kichawi
ambayo huenda hatujui tunaitoa wapi

00:05:11.117 --> 00:05:13.598
na inakwenda wapi, tuna variable hasa.

00:05:13.598 --> 00:05:17.997
Na tunaweza kuweka variable nyingine
tukitaka, yaani variable ya bendera, `flag`,

00:05:18.077 --> 00:05:22.557
ambayo ni 88. Na sasa umbali
ni bendera toa nafasi.

00:05:24.327 --> 00:05:26.447
Kuna jambo moja zaidi
kabla hatujaendelea,

00:05:26.447 --> 00:05:32.048
ambalo nataka kuhakikisha unalielewa kweli,
nalo ni kwamba kila mara, tukiwa.

00:05:32.048 --> 00:05:36.088
Kumbuka nilikufundisha kuhusu nukta hii ya rangi ya chungwa
hapo awali. Kila mara tunapofika kwenye mstari huu

00:05:36.487 --> 00:05:42.088
na Jiki anachukua umbali kutoka rafuni,
thamani yake bado ni 60.

00:05:43.767 --> 00:05:49.848
Hili ni muhimu sana. Kwa hiyo kwa sababu tu
Jiki amesasisha sanduku la nafasi hapa,

00:05:50.867 --> 00:05:53.187
hilo halisasishi sanduku la umbali.

00:05:54.067 --> 00:05:56.387
Vitu hivi viwili havihusiani kimiujiza.

00:05:56.788 --> 00:05:59.108
Si kama katika hisabati,
ambapo una, kama,

00:05:59.827 --> 00:06:02.307
milinganyo ambapo vitu
vinahusiana.

00:06:03.108 --> 00:06:07.427
Nafasi ni sanduku lake lenyewe.
Sasa lina 39 ndani yake.

00:06:07.507 --> 00:06:10.507
Tukisonga mbele hatua chache,
litakuwa na 40 ndani yake.

00:06:10.507 --> 00:06:13.507
Tukisonga mbele chache zaidi,
litakuwa na 41 ndani yake.

00:06:13.588 --> 00:06:16.548
Kwa hiyo sanduku hili la nafasi,
kilichomo ndani yake kinabadilika.

00:06:17.197 --> 00:06:21.117
Lakini sanduku la umbali? Hakuna
mahali popote katika msimbo huu tunaposema,

00:06:21.437 --> 00:06:23.278
badilisha kilichomo ndani ya sanduku la umbali.

00:06:23.437 --> 00:06:26.158
Tunaunda sanduku la umbali hapa tu,

00:06:27.437 --> 00:06:33.197
kwenye mstari huu. Na tunaweka thamani hii ndani yake,
tunaweka 60 katika sanduku hili, basi.

00:06:33.197 --> 00:06:35.038
Hatubadilishi kamwe kilichomo ndani ya sanduku hilo.

00:06:35.437 --> 00:06:39.197
Kwa hiyo hata ingawa tunaangalia ndani ya sanduku
mara nyingi, kila mara tunaporudia,

00:06:39.197 --> 00:06:40.237
tunaangalia ndani ya sanduku,

00:06:41.117 --> 00:06:43.197
hatubadilishi kamwe kilichomo ndani yake.

00:06:44.257 --> 00:06:46.737
Kwa hiyo hakikisha tu kwamba
umelielewa hilo vizuri kabisa.

00:06:49.377 --> 00:06:52.577
Sawa. Kwa hiyo hayo yote yanaeleweka.
Kwa nini msimbo haufanyi kazi?

00:06:53.617 --> 00:06:57.098
Kwa nini msimbo haufanyi kazi? Hapa ndipo
nadhani baadhi ya watu hukwama.

00:06:57.098 --> 00:07:00.697
Wanaandika kitu kama hiki. Hawajui
kwa nini hakifanyi kazi.

00:07:00.697 --> 00:07:05.377
Mwishowe wanaishia, kama, kubadilisha
hii 27 ili kujaribu kuifanya ifanye kazi.

00:07:05.458 --> 00:07:07.737
Na huenda kisha mambo haya mengine
yote hayafanyi kazi.

00:07:07.737 --> 00:07:10.627
Inabidi wafanye hivi,
na inakuwa fujo sana.

00:07:10.627 --> 00:07:12.987
Badala ya kufanya hivyo,
hebu tusimame, tupunguze kasi,

00:07:12.987 --> 00:07:15.427
tufikirie kwa nini
msimbo huu haufanyi kazi.

00:07:15.827 --> 00:07:18.108
Kwa hiyo soma msimbo. Kwa nini haufanyi kazi?

00:07:18.108 --> 00:07:21.028
Kwa nini mpira haufiki
unapohitaji kufika?

00:07:21.028 --> 00:07:24.387
Unafika 87, haufiki 88.

00:07:26.468 --> 00:07:28.788
Kuna sababu mbili. Inaweza kuwa si sahihi.

00:07:29.668 --> 00:07:33.108
Huenda tunarudia
idadi isiyo sahihi ya mara.

00:07:33.747 --> 00:07:36.548
Kwa hiyo tukirudia umbali jumlisha moja,

00:07:37.528 --> 00:07:38.968
sasa tungefika tunakokwenda.

00:07:39.127 --> 00:07:41.608
Lakini hilo linahisi ajabu sana.
Kwa nini tunafanya hivyo?

00:07:43.848 --> 00:07:45.367
Lakini jambo lingine linaweza kuwa,

00:07:46.487 --> 00:07:48.408
tulikuwa tunasogea hadi wapi hasa?

00:07:48.728 --> 00:07:50.327
Basi hebu turukie hapa,

00:07:51.208 --> 00:07:55.848
tuendeshe msimbo wetu. Na hebu tupande
hadi mwanzo kabisa na tuje hapa.

00:07:56.327 --> 00:08:01.767
Kwa hiyo mara ya kwanza tunapoita `move_to`,
tunakiita na nafasi ya 28.

00:08:02.497 --> 00:08:04.497
Unaweza kuona hapa nafasi ni 28.

00:08:04.817 --> 00:08:09.778
Tunatumia `move_to` 28,
lakini mpira ulikuwa tayari kwenye 28.

00:08:10.257 --> 00:08:13.377
Kwa hiyo mpira uko kwenye 28. Tunausogeza hadi 28.

00:08:13.697 --> 00:08:17.778
Kisha tukipitia hadi
mwisho na kuangalia tunakosogea,

00:08:18.257 --> 00:08:20.658
mahali pa mwisho kabisa tunaposogea ni 87.

00:08:21.137 --> 00:08:27.517
Kwa hiyo tunasogea hadi 28, unapoanzia,
tunakwenda mara 60 na kuishia

00:08:28.288 --> 00:08:29.247
mraba mmoja kabla ya kufika.

00:08:30.208 --> 00:08:32.048
Kwa hiyo unakumbuka katika video
iliyopita ya uchambuzi wa kina,

00:08:32.368 --> 00:08:37.967
nilisema wakati mwingine ni muhimu sana
kama tunafanya mambo kwa mpangilio huu

00:08:38.368 --> 00:08:42.207
au kwa mpangilio mwingine? Huu ni
mfano wa mahali ambapo hivyo ndivyo ilivyo

00:08:43.008 --> 00:08:47.168
hapa. Tayari tuna nafasi iliyowekwa,
kwa sababu hapo ndipo mpira unapoanzia.

00:08:47.327 --> 00:08:52.288
Tukifuta tu, kama, msimbo huu wote,
mpira unaanzia juu ya kigingi kwenye 28.

00:08:52.288 --> 00:08:53.168
Tayari uko pale.

00:08:54.077 --> 00:08:58.638
Kwa hiyo tunaposogeza mpira, mara ya kwanza
tunapousogeza, tunataka kuusogeza hadi 29.

00:08:59.278 --> 00:09:02.158
Tungeweza kuweka hii kuwa 29 kisha kufanya hivi,

00:09:03.197 --> 00:09:07.758
lakini kisha umbali huu utaharibika,
na msimbo wetu hautakuwa kweli tena kwa sababu

00:09:08.317 --> 00:09:12.878
mpira hauko kwenye 29 hapa.
Mpira uko kwenye 28 juu ya kigingi.

00:09:14.317 --> 00:09:16.518
Kwa hiyo tunachohitaji kufanya ni kwamba ndani ya kitanzi hiki,

00:09:16.518 --> 00:09:20.857
tunahitaji kusasisha nafasi kwanza kabla
hatujahuisha mpira na kuusogeza pale.

00:09:21.327 --> 00:09:22.288
Na tukifanya hivi,

00:09:24.927 --> 00:09:26.528
huku hii ikiwa imerudishwa kwenye namba sahihi,

00:09:26.607 --> 00:09:28.927
tukifanya hivi, msimbo unafanya kazi.

00:09:30.447 --> 00:09:33.567
Basi hebu tufikirie, kwa muhtasari
haraka, tulicho nacho hapa.

00:09:34.128 --> 00:09:38.368
Tumeweka variable kadhaa. Nafasi ya
awali ya mpira, ulipo juu ya kigingi,

00:09:38.528 --> 00:09:41.447
28, namba tuliyopewa. Tuna bendera.

00:09:41.447 --> 00:09:44.528
Bendera iko wapi? Ni namba 88,
namba tuliyopewa.

00:09:45.408 --> 00:09:47.648
Tunahitaji kwenda umbali gani? Basi,
tunahitaji kwenda

00:09:48.697 --> 00:09:51.658
kutoka nafasi hadi bendera,
kwa hiyo bendera toa nafasi,

00:09:52.538 --> 00:09:56.298
ili tuweze kwenda umbali huo,
mara hizo zote. Kila mara,

00:09:56.298 --> 00:09:58.538
tunahitaji kusogeza mpira
hatua moja mbele kisha

00:09:58.538 --> 00:10:01.097
kuhuisha mwendo hadi hatua hiyo.

00:10:03.258 --> 00:10:07.418
Kwa hiyo hili linaonekana kuwa zoezi
rahisi kiasi kwa wengi wenu.

00:10:07.977 --> 00:10:11.697
Lakini kwa kweli, kuna sehemu nyingi
ambapo unaweza kukwama kabisa,

00:10:11.697 --> 00:10:13.658
na nadhani kuna sehemu nyingi
ambapo unaweza tu

00:10:13.658 --> 00:10:16.097
kuanza kuchezea namba badala ya

00:10:16.097 --> 00:10:18.618
kupunguza kasi na kufikiri
kwa kina kuhusu kinachoendelea.

00:10:19.378 --> 00:10:22.018
Kwa hiyo natumaini katika video hii
unaweza kuona thamani ya

00:10:22.018 --> 00:10:24.937
kuweka variable hizi,
na jinsi tunavyoweza kutoa

00:10:24.937 --> 00:10:28.738
namba kutoka katika maagizo haya na
kuziweka humu kama data imara zaidi,

00:10:28.977 --> 00:10:34.177
data imara. Tuna
msemo katika kupanga programu: namba za kichawi.

00:10:34.177 --> 00:10:37.498
Na namba ya kichawi ni pale ambapo una
namba tu ndani ya msimbo wako.

00:10:37.498 --> 00:10:39.298
Kama tukiwa na hii 60 tu hapa

00:10:40.258 --> 00:10:44.018
na hatujui namba hii ni nini,
lakini inafanya tu msimbo ufanye kazi.

00:10:44.837 --> 00:10:48.197
Kila unapokuwa na hili, ni hatari
sana. Tunaiita harufu,

00:10:48.197 --> 00:10:51.477
harufu ya msimbo. Ni hatari
sana unapokuwa na hili

00:10:52.197 --> 00:10:55.557
kwa sababu hujui kwa kweli
60 hiyo inafanya nini.

00:10:55.557 --> 00:10:57.317
Mtu mwingine anayekuja kusoma msimbo

00:10:57.317 --> 00:10:59.638
hajui kwa kweli
60 hii inafanya nini.

00:11:00.597 --> 00:11:03.638
Ni bora zaidi kutumia
variable zenye maana.

00:11:04.038 --> 00:11:04.437
Kwa hiyo,

00:11:05.238 --> 00:11:08.878
tungeweza hata, unajua, kuiita hii nafasi ya mpira
na kuiita hii nafasi

00:11:08.878 --> 00:11:09.238
ya bendera.

00:11:10.607 --> 00:11:13.168
Kwa hiyo hii sasa inakuwa nafasi ya mpira,
nafasi ya bendera.

00:11:13.567 --> 00:11:15.648
Na tunataka kusogeza nafasi ya mpira.

00:11:16.927 --> 00:11:19.648
Ghafla inakuwa wazi kabisa
namba hizi ni nini.

00:11:20.048 --> 00:11:21.847
Inakuwa wazi kabisa kwamba
tunasogeza mpira.

00:11:21.847 --> 00:11:24.368
Msimbo unaanza kujieleza wenyewe.

00:11:25.457 --> 00:11:29.807
Kwa hiyo kama ulikwama kwenye zoezi hili,
natumaini unaweza kuona kwa nini.

00:11:29.807 --> 00:11:33.168
Kuna njia nyingi, nyingi sana
za kujikwamisha.

00:11:33.168 --> 00:11:36.447
Vipande vingi vya kusumbua humu. Na kama
ulifaulu mara ya kwanza,

00:11:36.447 --> 00:11:38.437
umefanya vizuri sana, hongera.

00:11:38.477 --> 00:11:42.018
Natumaini hii pia imekufanya
ufikiri kidogo na kupinga

00:11:42.717 --> 00:11:46.677
baadhi ya mawazo ambayo huenda
ulikuwa nayo ulipoanza zoezi hili.

